This is a working _non released_ stoopid, stoopid, stoopid, door that stops
users from entering in a screen size of less than 27 lines.  Don't ask me
why but MAXs seems to subtract 2, and thus the minimum is really 25.
Could be modified to really piss off your users >-]

To compile the source, you'll need SAS C 6.X.

To install it, just use sumthin' akin to this:

  KEY  FUNCTION  EXTRAS  LOW  HIGH   PATH/FILENAME
   5      34       0     10   10000  DOORS:MinRows/MinRows


